WEBVTT

00:18.378 --> 00:22.780
The streetlights make a blurry line

00:25.801 --> 00:30.264
I'm running through the same old signs

00:33.645 --> 00:36.507
I'm just a face in a passing crowd

00:39.666 --> 00:44.629
Afraid to speak my thoughts out loud

00:47.891 --> 00:53.094
But then you found me in the noise

00:55.276 --> 00:59.999
You heard a whisper in my voice

01:03.101 --> 01:06.282
You gave me something to believe

01:09.133 --> 01:14.979
A reason I would never leave

01:16.300 --> 01:23.968
If you walked away The sky would lose its blue I

01:24.028 --> 01:31.134
wouldn't know what to do I'd be lonely If you

01:31.434 --> 01:39.659
walked away My world would fall apart

01:41.440 --> 01:44.082
You're the owner of my heart

01:56.068 --> 02:01.371
they build these walls so high and steep

02:03.373 --> 02:08.496
with promises they never keep

02:10.997 --> 02:14.700
but we have a fortress strong and true

02:17.237 --> 02:27.986
I'm safe as long as I have you. If you walked away,

02:28.267 --> 02:33.511
the sky would lose its blue. I wouldn't know what

02:33.571 --> 02:34.432
to do.

02:37.134 --> 02:42.658
If you walked away,

02:43.018 --> 02:48.482
my world would fall apart.

02:49.563 --> 02:57.428
You're the owner of my neon heart.

03:07.633 --> 03:17.776
Don't let me go into the night

03:17.836 --> 03:24.738
If you walked away The sky would lose its blue I

03:25.598 --> 03:32.180
wouldn't know what to do I'd be lost in the gray If

03:32.540 --> 03:40.945
you walked away My world would fall apart

03:43.106 --> 03:48.610
You're the owner of my

03:48.970 --> 03:51.152
own heart

03:55.535 --> 03:58.137
Don't walk away

